# Production build of the web app. On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production), not a file.
# Locally: copy to .env.production.local (git-ignored). Public, not a secret: it ends up in the built JavaScript and in
# the Content-Security-Policy. The family server's API address, https, ending in /api/v1 (a Vercel production build
# refuses anything else):
VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-familyroots-site.example/api/v1
